  TO    cases/dafoam/ladder-a/A2/curriculum_D4_SHIPPED/d4s_run_arm.sh (NEW FILE)

WHY A NEW FILE AND NOT AN EDIT: the frozen launcher hardcodes BASE at the PATCHED
item's run root with no override (:25), and stages by `sudo -n rm -rf "$WORK"` (:139)
where WORK="$BASE/$ARM". There is NO argument, environment variable or working
