the artifacts D4's accepted GATE REACHED rests on. Eight launcher files in that
directory carry the same hardcoded BASE. Rule 6 forbids editing them.

WHAT CHANGED, IN FIVE PLACES:
  1. THE RUN ROOT, AND THREE GUARDS THAT MAKE THE WRONG CONSTANT REFUSE
       G-ROOT.1  BASE must equal the registered root, compared via realpath -m
       G-ROOT.2  explicit forbidden-roots list naming D4/D7R/D12R/D12R2
       G-ROOT.3  the ledger must carry no foreign ITEM= and no ROW=PATCHED row
